  "$comment": "Standard vocabulary for PROVENANCE.yml capabilities and constraints. Normative source: SPEC.md, Capability Vocabulary. Custom terms are allowed with a domain prefix (acme:custom-capability).",
  "version": "0.2",
  "capabilities": {
